<title>UK: UK election to take place by May 1 - Major.</title>
<headline>UK election to take place by May 1 - Major.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Prime Minister John Major said on Sunday the general election will take place by May 1997 at the latest.</p>
<p>In an interview with BBC television he said the general election would take place &quot;not later than May 1&quot;.  </p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7715</p>
</text>
